{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think fast, blast smart, and master the grid!\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Koko Loco Block Blast</i> is a colorful and addictive block puzzle game where every move counts. Place sets of three shapes onto the board, clear lines to score points, and keep the grid from filling up.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead, chain combos, and climb the high-score ladder! Whether you\u2019re chasing your next personal best or relaxing with a few quick rounds, <i>Koko Loco Block Blast</i> delivers satisfying brain-teasing fun for players of all ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive Puzzle Action</strong> \u2013 Simple to play, challenging to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo System</strong> \u2013 Clear lines in succession to maintain your streak and multiply your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth Controls</strong> \u2013 Click and drag shapes easily using your mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Visuals</strong> \u2013 Enjoy colorful designs and crisp effects with each block you place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Rounds, Endless Challenge</strong> \u2013 Perfect for both short sessions and long strategy runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax or Compete</strong> \u2013 Chill or push for the top score \u2014 it\u2019s up to you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099790/extras/7c6b7577482aba88ce247370673a0cdb.poster.avif?t=1766150363\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099790/extras/7c6b7577482aba88ce247370673a0cdb.webm?t=1766150363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50 <strong>Combo System Explained</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear at least one line every three shapes to keep your combo alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A combo meter shows three green bars \u2014 each time you fail to clear a line, one disappears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep clearing lines to refill the meter and build bigger scores!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart the grid and master the combo? <br><strong>Koko Loco Block Blast</strong> \u2014 easy to pick up, hard to put down! <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099790/extras/bf3501a3434ad27f5b141061f470fd3a.poster.avif?t=1766150363\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099790/extras/bf3501a3434ad27f5b141061f470fd3a.webm?t=1766150363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099790/extras/4df1f9ad848c5aaafb2341926eaa1f28.poster.avif?t=1766150363\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099790/extras/4df1f9ad848c5aaafb2341926eaa1f28.webm?t=1766150363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4