uals</strong> \u2013 Enjoy colorful designs and crisp effects with each block you place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Rounds, Endless Challenge</strong> \u2013 Perfect for both short sessions and long strategy runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax or Compete</strong> \u2013 Chill or push for the top score \u2014 it\u2019s up to you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099790/extras/7c6b7577482aba88ce247370673a0cdb.poster.avif?t=1766150363\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099790/extras/7c6b7577482aba88ce247370673a0cdb.webm?t=1766150363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50 <strong>Combo System Explained</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear at least one line every three shapes to keep your combo alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A combo meter shows three green bars \u2014 each time you fail to clear a line, one disappears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep clearing lines to refill the meter and build bigger scores!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart the grid and master the combo? <br><strong>Koko Loco Block Blast</strong> \u2014 easy to pick up, hard to put down! <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099790/extras/bf3501a3434ad27f5b141061f470fd3a.poster.avif?t=1766150363\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps